    If this card is Link Summoned: You can target 1 "Infernoble Knight
    Emperor Charles" in your GY; this card''s name becomes that target''s original
    name, and it gains that target''s original effects, then equip that target to
    this card as an Equip Spell that gives it 500 ATK. Once per turn, when a Spell/Trap
    Card or effect is activated (Quick Effect): You can send 1 Equip Spell from your
    hand or face-up field to the GY; negate the activation, and if you do, destroy
    that card.'
